Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.60,0:00:05.60,Brand,,0,0,0,,{\fad(600,700)}D I D A O
Dialogue: 1,0:00:00.90,0:00:05.60,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,700)}THE FOREST HAS NO EXIT
Dialogue: 1,0:00:01.40,0:00:05.60,Ep,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,700)}Episode 1: The Last Night
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.60,0:00:06.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}There were three of us. One weekend. A forest nobody had camped in for years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.50,0:00:10.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We thought it was just a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.50,0:00:14.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}By nightfall, we had a tent, a fire…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.70,0:00:18.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and the strange feeling that we weren't alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.30,0:00:23.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Lena saw it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.70,0:00:28.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Something tall. Between the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.10,0:00:30.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It wasn't moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.10,0:00:34.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I pointed my flashlight at it…
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:36.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}and it was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.90,0:00:39.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Max said it was just a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.20,0:00:44.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Around midnight, I woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.40,0:00:49.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}The fire was out. The forest had gone completely silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.40,0:00:59.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Footsteps. Three slow steps. Right outside the tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.60,0:01:06.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It was closer now. Much closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.40,0:01:09.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}And it was watching our tent.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.50,0:01:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I woke the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:18.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But by the time we got outside… there was no one there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.00,0:01:24.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}In the morning, we packed up to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.40,0:01:27.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But the path we came in on… was gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.60,0:01:34.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Then I saw the words carved into a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.60,0:01:37.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}Do not look back.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.50,0:01:42.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}We'd had no signal for hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:44.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}But my phone buzzed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.60,0:01:47.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}One new message.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.60,0:01:50.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}I looked up…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.00,0:01:55.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,120)}It wasn't alone.
